# Build artifacts
*.zip
bin/
obj/

# Local build output (build.sh writes here; never commit binaries)
out/
# Scratch files (commit messages, notes, analysis dumps) never belong in the repo.
# The pattern covers EVERY extension: an analysis dump written as .json or .md
# slipped past a __*.txt rule and landed in four commits.
__msg.txt
__*
# Python bytecode from the test scripts
__pycache__/
*.pyc
